{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>彭博的 Mark Gurman 在其 Power On 播客的新一集中表示，他聽聞 Apple 正研究未來 iPhone Duo 採用較現有型號大約半吋的內螢幕。</p>\n<h2>內螢幕或達 8.1 吋</h2>\n<p>現有 iPhone Duo 的內螢幕為 7.6 吋，外螢幕為 5.4 吋。Gurman 表示，未確切知道未來型號的內螢幕會增大多少，但可能落在 7.9 吋至 8.1 吋之間。</p>\n<p>他亦指出，這不會是另一個獨立型號，因此外界不應期待出現「iPhone Duo Max」。</p>\n<img alt=\"與 iPhone Duo 相關的圖片\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/iphone-duo-standby.webp\">\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T20:19:37.097845+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":226,"images":1,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T20:10:04+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T02:58:33.380734+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T20:18:10.721697+00:00","content_hash":"c585276b0e8d87d2bae27ad1f4a1d7cd13171e26c55b7c8062ebaeae3bdb41cc","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}